{"id":"vod_sn_38974","vodId":"38974","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天华百剑 ～欢迎来到铭治馆!～","name_cn":"天华百剑 ～欢迎来到铭治馆!～","date":"2019-01-01","year":"2019","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f5f5f493a6a62cee6a6261f19ba49154.jpg"},"summary":"《天华百剑 ～欢迎来到铭治馆！～》讲述改编自同名多媒体企划，凶祸是很久以前就存在的邪恶灵魂根源。自古以来凶祸会诞生出异形之物，在人世间带来混乱。拥有刀是理所当然的时代，当时的有力者们创造出能与凶祸抗衡的力量，那就是巫剑，是一种化为女性姿态的特别刀刃。她们会与被选上的人进行契约仪式，并在获得主人巫剑使者的时候解放能力。接着，巫剑与巫剑使者为了要封印永生不灭的存在凶祸，便在历史的台面下持续进行战斗。来到了铭治（めいじ）时代法令禁止人们带刀，人们已经忘记了巫剑存在的时代。因近代化而渐渐改变的人与城市,但台面下与凶祸之间的战斗又再次开始了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tVwSrtjPpg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LvwHYFerLT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ly2Z0geN4Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PmMkGDsi5f1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XrCHbMASJe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p6YSY6Rdea1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CafwYYVhJz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J38ebCxd1F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pRHmBvVsYK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xP6ajk1iJH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EDxwdvDrGv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/D4xMpBHXy31/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:51.948Z"}